{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065784/block/singleImage/3278433/df/01M8A4YB65N4P8GF3KFPC9M1HQ.jpg?updatedAt=1795637135\"/><figcaption>教育局今年接15校申請 5中學獲批中一「4變5」</figcaption></figure><p>下學年有5間中學獲教育局批准中一由4班增至5班，包括北區的粉嶺禮賢會中學、香港道教聯合會鄧顯紀念中學、田家炳中學，以及東區的港島民生書院、聖馬可中學。 教育局表示，今年共接獲15間中學申請中一「4變5」，經詳細審視學校配套設施、辦學往績、家長意願、香港整體學額供求情況，以及學校所在地區的實際情況等各項因素，批准該5間中學的申請。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T21:44:19.815176+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T23:10:20.318409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T21:37:37.543528+00:00","content_hash":"971d92dadf9c57ebd365c9388dcaac1e391409f6388f471d212c0fd44696e270","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T21:44:19.815176+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}